 "notes": [
  "Rows 11-13 of image 0084_0091 (13 + 14 + 15) and rows 1-4 of 0084_0092 (11 + 17 + 12 + 7) = 89. The record has 12 on 43v l.11: the angle < in the left margin of l.11 (as on l.13) is the first ا of الغمائم; l.12 opens with a divider in the margin.",
  "الغمائم: the group is < | ◁ I(three dots) Λ < o Λ, 7 signs, with the ring o (ي in الريح, على, سندسي, حدايقه) as the hamza seat; the record's الغمام has 6. The three dots above the I-beam belong to the sign (غ), not a divider; the plain I-beam with upturned ends is س (سندسي).",
  "خبت: its first sign is the ⊏-with-stem that writes خ in خد (cmp_jkh.png), and the clear text on 44r l.5 is dotted خبت (clear5L.png); the record's جبت [?] is a misreading. الاناعم and وادقه are confirmed letter for letter (ا ل ا ن ا ع م; و ا د ق ه).",
  "Two flag signs: ◁ on a slanting stem = ل (7), flag with a tail bar = ب (4); two hooks: ق is a long bar with a hook (4), ح the open ha (2); the star is د (5), the bowl-Y و (6). The record's note that the الغمام group 'does not repeat mim' is explained: its 4th and 7th signs are both Λ = م, with ا and ئ between.",
  "A divider stands at the start of 44r l.4 (after سندسي), so سندسي and حدايقه are separate groups; the record's 21 groups counted them as one."
 ],
